# Enterprise E-commerce API Examples

This file contains comprehensive example API requests for testing the Enterprise E-commerce API with authentication, cart management, and order processing.

### Authentication Endpoints

# Register a new customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Customer",
  "role": "customer"
}

###

# Register a new vendor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Vendor",
  "role": "vendor"
}

###

# Register an admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "first_name": "Admin",
  "last_name": "User",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

# Login as customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

# Login as vendor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

# Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### User Management

# Get user profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

# Update user profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Updated",
  "last_name": "Name"
}

###

# Get users by role (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?role=vendor&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Product Management

# Create a product (Vendor/Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Bluetooth Headphones",
  "description": "Premium wireless headphones with active noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and crystal-clear sound quality. Perfect for music lovers and professionals.",
  "brand": "AudioTech",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 299.99,
  "stock_quantity": 50,
  "sku": "AT-WBH-001",
  "weight": 0.6,
  "dimensions": "22x18x8cm",
  "image_urls": [
    "https://example.com/headphones-main.jpg",
    "https://example.com/headphones-side.jpg"
  ],
  "tags": ["wireless", "bluetooth", "noise-cancellation", "premium"]
}

###

# Create another product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smartphone Case",
  "description": "Durable protective case for smartphones with shock absorption and wireless charging compatibility.",
  "brand": "ProtectPro",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 24.99,
  "stock_quantity": 100,
  "sku": "PP-SC-002",
  "weight": 0.1,
  "dimensions": "16x8x1cm",
  "image_urls": [
    "https://example.com/case-front.jpg",
    "https://example.com/case-back.jpg"
  ],
  "tags": ["protection", "smartphone", "wireless-charging"]
}

###

# Get all products (Public)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=1&size=20

###

# Search products (Public)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=headphones&brand=AudioTech&min_price=200&max_price=400

###

# Search with multiple filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=bluetooth&category=Electronics&sort_by=price&sort_order=asc

###

# Get specific product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{product_id}}

###

# Update product (Vendor/Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 279.99,
  "stock_quantity": 45,
  "description": "UPDATED: Premium wireless headphones with active noise cancellation, 35-hour battery life, and enhanced sound quality."
}

###

### Shopping Cart

# Add item to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{product_id}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

# Add another item to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{product_id_2}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

# Get cart
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###

# Update cart item quantity
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/{{cart_item_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

###

# Remove item from cart
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/{{cart_item_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###

### Order Management

# Create order from cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipping_address": {
    "street": "123 Main Street, Apt 4B",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "zip_code": "94105",
    "country": "USA",
    "phone": "+1-555-123-4567"
  },
  "billing_address": {
    "street": "123 Main Street, Apt 4B",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "zip_code": "94105",
    "country": "USA",
    "phone": "+1-555-123-4567"
  },
  "notes": "Please deliver between 9 AM and 5 PM. Ring doorbell twice."
}

###

# Get user orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###

# Get specific order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###

# Update order status (Vendor/Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

###

# Update order status to processing
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "processing"
}

###

# Update order status to shipped
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "shipped"
}

###

# Cancel order (Customer/Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###

### Analytics (Admin Only)

# Get order analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Performance Comparison

# Compare search performance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/performance/headphones

###

# Batch performance comparison
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/performance/batch?terms=headphones,smartphone,bluetooth

###

### Health Check

# Check API health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###

### Advanced Search Examples

# Search with aggregations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=electronics&page=1&size=20

###

# Search by brand and category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?brand=AudioTech&brand=ProtectPro&category=Electronics

###

# Price range search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?min_price=20&max_price=300&sort_by=price&sort_order=desc

###

# Full-text search with sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=wireless bluetooth premium&sort_by=created_at&sort_order=desc

###

### Admin User Management

# Get all vendors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?role=vendor
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# Get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?role=customer
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# Get specific user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# Update user role
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "vendor"
}

###

# Deactivate user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# Activate user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

# Clear cart
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

## Search Products (CQRS Query - uses Elasticsearch exclusively)

### Basic text search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=iPhone

### Search with filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=smartphone&brand=Apple&min_price=500&max_price=1500

### Search with pagination and sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=laptop&page=1&size=10&sort_by=price&sort_order=asc

### Filter by multiple brands
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?brand=Apple&brand=Samsung&brand=Google

### Filter by category and price range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?category=Electronics&min_price=100&max_price=500

### Complex search with all parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?q=wireless%20headphones&brand=Sony&brand=Bose&category=Audio&min_price=50&max_price=300&page=1&size=20&sort_by=price&sort_order=desc

## Performance Comparison
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/performance/iPhone
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/performance/laptop
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/performance/headphones

## Get Single Product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{product-id}

## Update Product (CQRS Command - updates PostgreSQL → updates Elasticsearch)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{product-id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1099.99,
  "stock_quantity": 30
}

## Delete Product (CQRS Command - deletes from PostgreSQL → removes from Elasticsearch)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{product-id}

## Example Response Structure

### Search Response with Aggregations
```json
{
  "products": [
    {
      "id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
      "name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
      "description": "Latest Apple smartphone...",
      "brand": "Apple",
      "category": "Smartphones",
      "price": 999.99,
      "stock_quantity": 25,
      "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "total": 147,
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "aggregations": {
    "brands": {
      "buckets": [
        {"key": "Apple", "doc_count": 45},
        {"key": "Samsung", "doc_count": 32},
        {"key": "Google", "doc_count": 18}
      ]
    },
    "categories": {
      "buckets": [
        {"key": "Smartphones", "doc_count": 95},
        {"key": "Electronics", "doc_count": 52}
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

### Performance Comparison Response
```json
{
  "postgresql_time": "150ms",
  "elasticsearch_time": "12ms",
  "speedup_factor": 12.5,
  "query": "iPhone"
}
```